.TH std::codecvt_byname 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::codecvt_byname \- std::codecvt_byname

.SH Synopsis
Defined in header <locale>
template< class InternT, class ExternT, class State >
class codecvt_byname : public std::codecvt<InternT, ExternT, State>;

std::codecvt_byname is a std::codecvt facet which encapsulates multibyte/wide character
conversion rules of a locale specified at its construction.

.SH Specializations

The standard library is guaranteed to provide the following specializations:

Defined in header <locale>
